# ==UserScript==
# @name         Dr. Torkzadeh Auto-Reservation v6
# @namespace    http://tampermonkey.net/
# @version      6.0
# @description  Reliable tab handling with focused element targeting
# @author       Assistant
# @match        http://www.drtorkzadeh.com/*
# @grant        GM_setValue
